[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7441.27, "timestamp": "02:04:01", "text": "这？我应该为他们高兴，但为什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7444.39, "timestamp": "02:04:04", "text": "我是这样看待它的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7446.31, "timestamp": "02:04:06", "text": "我当时就在质疑这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7450.629, "timestamp": "02:04:10", "text": "我自己当时就觉得它变成了一个m"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7453.91, "timestamp": "02:04:13", "text": "这一点在我访问他们的直播时得到了证实"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7456.709, "timestamp": "02:04:16", "text": "这种想法再次浮现，直击要害。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7460.229, "timestamp": "02:04:20", "text": "我当时就想，好吧，也许可以去参观一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7462.709, "timestamp": "02:04:22", "text": "频道或其内容等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7464.709, "timestamp": "02:04:24", "text": "如果这让我难过，那我就会远离。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7467.91, "timestamp": "02:04:27", "text": "过一段时间，然后随着时间的推移就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7470.95, "timestamp": "02:04:30", "text": "慢慢消失了。我当时就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7473.189, "timestamp": "02:04:33", "text": "是的，而不是与他人比较"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7475.99, "timestamp": "02:04:35", "text": "或者其他任何事情，只要专注于我的东西就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7479.189, "timestamp": "02:04:39", "text": "比较我的东西，呃，就像评论一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7480.91, "timestamp": "02:04:40", "text": "我自己和喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7484.709, "timestamp": "02:04:44", "text": "比过去的自己更好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7487.75, "timestamp": "02:04:47", "text": "第二天等等。是的。做得更好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7490.55, "timestamp": "02:04:50", "text": "下次再这样吧。以及那种心态"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7491.55, "timestamp": "02:04:51", "text": "做过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7495.51, "timestamp": "02:04:55", "text": "帮助。而每当我几乎要得到那个的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7498.31, "timestamp": "02:04:58", "text": "像果冻一样的感觉，或者像果冻一样的感觉，"}]